T1-014  [T1] Expected artifact exists with checksum
T1-015  [T1] Counter increments by exact delta
T1-016  [T1] Soft-delete sets deleted_at, preserves row
T1-017  [T1] Concurrent twin runs: exactly-one winner
T1-018  [T1] API success flag matches terminal oracle
T2-001  [T2] Prerequisite tool succeeds before dependent tool runs
T2-002  [T2] Irreversible action never precedes a later-fixed prerequisite
